<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">AKOLOSAI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kolo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Akolosai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Akolosai</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akolosai</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa Akolosai</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua kwa Akolosai yaandikilwe na Ntumilwe Pauli (1:1). Aandike balua yi'no abile muutabilwe mumuyi wa Roma. Yendawesekana panga yaandikilwe mwaka wa 60 bu'ka belekwa Yesu Kilisitu. Balua kwa Akolosai pamope na yi'lu' yi'ngi' kwa Aefeso na Filemoni ikemelwa balua ya muutabilwe bu'kana na ukakape panga Pauli aandike abile muutabilwe. Aandike balua yi'no kwa kanisa lyalyabile mumuyi wa Kolosai. Pauli kwenda nga ywalitumbwi kanisa lya Akolosai li kati mwaawanikiye mu 2:1, lakini yendawesekana panga aaibweni panga ywembe nga kitumbu kwa kanisa lyo. Pi'ngi' kanisa li' lyatumbulilwe na Epafrodito kwa mwanjaa ywembe aai mwenekaya wa Kolosai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli aang'ang'amuyilwe na mayi'gano nsi'si' ga ubu'su' mukanisa lya Kolosai. Kipande kiku'lu' sa balua yo saalongeli bu'kana na likowe lyo. Yendawesekana panga kwabile na kipi'nga sa Akilisitu bene kibelekwe sa Kiyahudi babapayage kwali'ndi'ndi'lya Akilisitu bi'ngi' bakoteye salya ya Kiyahudi yaibu'kana na Lilagano lya Kwai'mbu', na muno nga likowe lyo inilwa liku'mbi'. Pauli aandika kwo binia muno panga Akilisitu bapalali sosoti au ywoywoti ila Kilisitu li'nga bayi'ki'ti'lwe na Nnu'ngu', no panga mayi'gano gene misingi yake mumaganiyo ga kimundu, gapwaikali (2:8).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pauli atumbwa balua yake kwa kulisalimia kanisa lyalibile ku Kolosai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Aandika bu'kana na Uku'lu' wa Kilisitu, li'no nga lya ngama lyayangwile bu'kana na mayi'gano ga ubu'su' gagabambite mu Kolosai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 1:3-3:4">1:3-3:4</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Kati mwayaabile mubalua yake yambone Pauli atumya nusu yi'ngi' ya balua kwo awanikia wisowiso mwaipalikwa Akilisitu batame <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 3:5-4:6">3:5-4:6</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Pauli ayomolya kwo piya salamu no awanikia panga balua yi'no isomelwe nnu'ngi' ya aumini boti bababile <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-4:18</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Balua yi'no iandikilwe na nenga na Pauli, nantumilwe wa Yesu Kilisitu kati mwapendi Nnu'ngu', na nnongo witu Timoteo. <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Tumwandikya mwaapeleteu mwamuu'bi'li'ka mu Kilisitu mwamubile Kolosai. Ngu'ngu' na amani yaibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu ibe pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sala yo sukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Kila patunnu'bya, tunsukulu Nnu'ngu' Tati' wa Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Na twenga tunsukulu ywembe kwa mwanjaa tuyu'wine bu'kana no u'bi'lya kwinu mu Kilisitu Yesu, na upendo winu kwa apeleteu boti. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Imani na upendo winu, ibu'kana na mau'bi'lyo gagabi'kilwe kunani na Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sinu. Alyo nga liu'bi'lyo li'li'lu'li'lu' lyamwabile nalyo bu'ka pamwatumbwi aalilwa abali ya kweli, lombolya Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Abali Inannoga yo yayaaikite kwinu mwenga, ilandala mudunia yoti, no yendelya kwapanga bandu bagalambuki kwa Nnu'ngu' kati mu'lu' mwayaapiti kwinu tumbulya lisu'ba lyamwayu'wine na kwitanga kakape ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Abali yo mwaiyu'wine bu'ka kwa Epafila, ywembe ntumisi ywapendilwe pamope na twenga. Ayu' atuyangatia twenga kati ntumisi wa Kilisitu ywau'bi'li'ka. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Ywembe ngaywaatupei abali ya upendo winu wamuyaliwite bu'ka kwa Loo.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Kwa kitumbu si', tunatotokelwali kunnu'bya mwenga bu'ka lisu'ba lyatuyu'wine abali yinu. Tunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' annyu'gu'li kugatanga munomuno gaagapenda ywembe na kuntwi'li'ya ikima no tanga kwakubu'ka kwa Loo wake, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />li'nga ago gannyangatiye tama maisa gagannetya Bwana isima na kumpulaisa ywembe muali yoti. Maisa ginu gabeleye itunda inannoga ya sampuli mbali'mbali', no yongeya kuntanga Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Tulu'ba Nnu'ngu' ankangamaye kwa makakala gake maku'lu' li'nga muwese komeya goti pangali totokelwa. Bai, munapusike, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />kamwasukulu Tati' babapangite muwese panga kiselele muulisi wa apeleteu babatama muukulungwa wa bweya. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Aatukosopoli bu'ka muukulungwa wa lubi'ndu' na kutuamiya tuyingi muukulungwa wa Mwana wake ywampendile, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />kwo pi'tya Mwana wake tukombolilwe, na masambi gitu gasamilwe.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilisitu na lyengo lyake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kilisitu nga kuminyo ya Nnu'ngu' ywangali bonekana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:15">mmele mwene amuli kwa yumbe yoti.<verse eid="COL 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Kwa ywembe ili'be yoti yaatiumbilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:16">yaibile padunia na kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:16">yaibonekana na yangali bonekana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:16">bene lenji, akulungwa, atawala au bene amuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:16">yoti yaumbilwe kwake ywembe, na kwa kitumbu sake.<verse eid="COL 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Ywembe aabile ili'be yoti ibile balo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:17">yoti iba kwa uweso wake.<verse eid="COL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Ywembe nga ntwe wa yi'ga yake, lombolya kanisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:18">ywembe nga kitumbu sa bwu'mi wa ayo yi'ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:18">Ywembe nga nnongoi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:18">mmele bu'ka kuuwi'li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:18">li'nga abe nnongoi wa ili'be yoti.<verse eid="COL 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Mwanjaa, Nnu'ngu' aapendi timilika kwake kwoti kube nkati yake Mwana.<verse eid="COL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Kwa ywembe ili'be yoti yaawaniyilwe na Nnu'ngu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:20">kwa myai yake munsalaba aaipangite amani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:20">na ili'be yoti ya mudunia na kunani.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Kwai'mbu', mwenga mwabile kuutalu na Nnu'ngu' kwa mwanjaa mwaai mwaandumu bake bu'kana no wasa kwinu na itibe yinu akau. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Lakini nambi'yambi' bu'kana na kiwo sa Mwana wake ywaatami pano padunia, Nnu'ngu' amwawaniye na ywembe li'nga ammi'ke nnu'ngi' yake mubile mwaapeleteu, mwalengelya pangali laumilwa. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Ila kanemuyi'ki'ti kunyangunyilwa bu'ka muliu'bi'lyo li'lu' lyamulipatike palu' pamwiyu'wine Abali Inannoga yaialilwe kwa kila mundu pano padunia. Nenga na Pauli naabile na ntumisi wa Injili yo. <verse eid="COL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Nambi'yambi', niipulaikya ngu'su'mbu' yaniipata kwa kitumbu sinu. Muyi'ga yangu' nipanga kiselele na ngu'su'mbu' ya Kilisitu yaiyendelya kwa kitumbu sa yi'ga yake, lombolya kanisa.<verse eid="COL 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mengo ga Pauli mumakanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Bu'kana na mwabi'kite Nnu'ngu', aanibi'kite nenga nipange nantumisi wake li'nga nimwali mwenga mu'lu' mwaibile Abali Inannoga yake yoti. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Abali yo nga yi'lu' iyo yayaaiyilwe bu'ka kwai'mbu' kwa mbelekwo yoti, lakini nambi'yambi' aumukulile apeleteu. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Nnu'ngu' apalike kwabakia bandu bangali Ayahudi uku'lu' wa iyo yo. Nayembe nga yi'no, Kilisitu abile nkati yinu, lombolya panga liu'bi'lyo lya utukupu. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Kwa kitumbu so, tumwala Kilisitu kwa bandu boti, kwakalipya na kwayi'gana boti kwa ikima yoti li'nga tuwese kunneta kwa Nnu'ngu' kila mundu abile nkomala kwo lu'mbana na Kilisitu. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Kwo panga nya, nipanga lyengo kwo kasana, kanitumya na makakala maku'lu' ganipeyilwe na Kilisitu. Makakala go gapanga kasi muno mumaisa gangu'.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Nipala mutange mu'lu' mwanikasana panga kasi kwa kitumbu sinu, kwa kitumbu sa aumini ba Laodikia na kwa kitumbu sa boti bababile balo kunibona. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Nipala aumini boti bapendane no kangamayana bene na bene. Kwo panga nyo, Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kwayalya muno li'nga batimi tanga wiso iyo yaiumukulilwe na Nnu'ngu', lombolya Kilisitu mwene. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Nkati yake nga mwagaiyilwe mabi'ko goti ga ikima na ilimu.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Nimmakianga go li'nga mwaakane yi'ki'tya kongelwa na mundu ywoywoti kwa makowe gake ga ubu'su', ata ikatei gabonekana go utya muno. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Pamope no panga nibile kuutalu na mwenga, lakini nibile pamope na mwenga kwa Loo. Nipulaika mu'lu' mwanimmona kamupanga kasi pamope kinannoga no kangamala kwa imani yinu kwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maisa gagatimile mu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa mumwu'bi'li Kilisitu Yesu nga Bwana, muyendeli tama kwo lu'mbana nakwe. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Na ndandai yinu iyendeli ku'la ata nkati yake na kwisenga muimani kati mu'lu' mwamuyi'ganilwe. Kai', mube mwabandu ba kunsukulu Nnu'ngu' wakati woti.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Mutame minyo kanemuyi'ki'ti mayi'gano ga ubu'su', gagabu'kana na mimu ya bandu na ndi'la yaitawala dunia yi'no. Mayi'gano go, gabu'kanali na Kilisitu. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Nilongela li' kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' kati mwabile ntimya kwa Unnu'ngu' wake, ubile nkati ya Kilisitu. Ayi' yaai ata mumaisa gake pano padunia. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Kwa mwanjaa mwenga mutimilike kwo lu'mbana na Kilisitu. Ywembe nga ntawala wa kila makakala na kulungwa yi'ngi' yoti.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Mwainilwe mu Kilisitu kwenda kwa maboko ga kimunduli, ila kwa ndi'la yo ula yi'ga yinu ya sambi. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Na pamubatisilwe, mwatisikilwa no yu'ka pamope nakwe bu'kana no u'bi'lya kwinu kwa makakala ga Nnu'ngu' ywannyu'yite Kilisitu bu'ka mukiwo. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Namwenga mwaai kati mwawaa kwa kitumbu sa masambi ginu, kai' mwainilweli yi'ga yinu ya sambi, lakini Nnu'ngu' aampei ukoto pamope na Kilisitu na atusami masambi gitu goti. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Aakiputike seti sa leni sa kutusitakya na kutuukumu, na kuibu'ya, kwikong'ondya munsalaba kaneibe kai'. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Kwa ndi'la ya nsalaba, Kilisitu aapokonywi utawala kwa atawala na bene yeo, ngaasinda kwa si'li'ku'si'li'ku' na kwapeya oni bandu kabalola.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Bai, mundu kaneansenwe bu'kana na yakulya, au yamunywaa, au si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya dini au lisu'ba lyo boneka kwa mwei, au lisu'ba lya Sabato. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Ago goti, kiwili bai sa makowe gagalu'a isa. Lakini makowe ga kakape gabonekana mu Kilisitu mwene. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Kanemuyi'ki'ti ukumilwa na mundu ywoywoti ywailaya kwa panja panga ywembe endagegekeya na kwakilikitya malaika. Mundu ywa kubi nnya aipunia ulalo wa mawaso gake ga kimundu. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Ywembe alu'mbanali na ntwe, lombolya Kilisitu, na yi'ga yoti imwu'bi'lya ywembe. Kwa kitumbu sa Kilisitu, ili'mbi'li'mbi' yoti ya payi'ga yendakotana no yangatiyana simo na si'ngi', kwo bu'kana na Nnu'ngu' mwaipeya uweso wo ku'la.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waa no tama pamope na Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Bai, manaitei mwawile pamope na Kilisitu na kuileka ndi'la yaitawala dunia yi'no, mwanjaa namani mwiyingiya pai' ya salya kati mwabatama bandu ba mudunia yi'no? <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Kanemukamwe si'lu'!” “Kanemupaye si'!” “Kanemukunywe si'!” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Salya yi' ilagya ikowe ya padunia, ikowe yooba bu'ka pakwitumya. Amuli yi' na mayi'gano gake, ga kimundu bai. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Salya yi', ibonekana panga ya ikima bu'kana na ibala yo li'ndi'ndi'lya, gegekeya kwa panja na kwitawala yi'ga kwa malango, lakini ipwaikali kugakanikia maminyikiyo ga payi'ga.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa mwaayu'yilwe pamope na Kilisitu, mugapale gagabile kunani kwabile Kilisitu, ywatama kummalyo ga Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Kanemuwase gano gagabile pano padunia, ila muwase gagabile kunani. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Kwa mwanjaa, mwawile na bwu'mi winu wiyilwe pamope na Kilisitu nkati ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Bwu'mi winu ubu'kana na Kilisitu. Palu' paalu'a bonekana, namwenga nga pamwaalu'a bonekana pamope nakwe no panga kiselele muutukupu wake.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maisa ga kwai'mbu' na maisa gayambi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Kwa nyo, mugataikuli kuutalu makowe goti ga mudunia yi'no gagabile nkati yinu kati upege, usapu, maminyikio malau, mawaso maakau, no minyikia mali, ipanga nsawani na kwikilikitya inyago paali pa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Kwa kitumbu sa makowe kati go, Nnu'ngu' ngaausikya bandu bangali kunnyu'wa. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Namwenga kwai'mbu' mwaapangite malau, pamutami kati bembe. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Lakini nambi'yambi' mupalikwa mulekangane na makowe aga goti kati nyongo, minyikia na ulau, matukano au mayi'gi'yo gangali pwaika, katu kanegayu'wanike mumikano yinu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Kanemukongane kwa mwanjaa, muulike ube winu wa kwai'mbu' na iyendo yake, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />na nambi'yambi' muuweti ube wayambi' waupangika wayambi' kila lisu'ba mpaka kuwikya utangi waubu'kana na Nnu'ngu' ywamuumbike mwenga. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Apo, ntu'pu' Nnyunani au Nnyahudi, mwinilwa au ywangainilwa, nng'eni au ywangali soma au mmanda au ngwana. Kilisitu nga ywangama muno na abile nkati yinu mwaboti.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa mwenga musaulilwe na Nnu'ngu' na mwaapeleteu mwamupendelwa, apala mube na mwoyo wa kiya, mwanoga mwoyo, mwaagegekeu, mwatu'lya na mwakomeyi. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Mukomeyane no samyana. Manaitei yumo ywinu abile na kitumbu na nnyine, mupalikwa samyana kati mu'lu' Bwana mwansami mwenga. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Pamope na ago goti, muuwale upendo. Wembe nga kili'be sakilu'mbaniya kamilika. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Amani ya Kilisitu itawale mumyoyo yinu. Mwenga mupangike mwa yi'ga yimo, kwa nyo mukemilwe tama kwa amani. Kai', kanemulibali kunsukulu Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Liyi'gi'yo lya Kilisitu liyolokane nkati yinu, muyi'ganane no kwi'li'kana kwa ikima yoti. Munnyi'mbi Nnu'ngu' kwa myoyo yinu yo sukulu kamutumya Zabuli, tenzi, na myambo ya Loo. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Lyolyoti lyamupanga au longela, mupange kwa lina lya Bwana Yesu kamwasukulu Tati' Nnu'ngu' kwo pi'tya ywembe.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaipalikwa alongo mu maisa gayambi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Mwenga mwaalwawa, mwayu'we akinaasengo binu kati mu'lu' mwaipalikwa kwa bandu babamwu'bi'lya Bwana. <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Na mwenga mwanalu'me, mwapende akinaayumbo binu kanemube mwakali' kwabe.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Mwenga mwabana, mwayu'we abelei binu kwa makowe goti, kwo panga nya mumpulaisa Bwana. <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Mwenga mwaakinatati', kanemwasokesoke bana binu baakane ti'kwanika mwoyo.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Mwenga mwaabanda, mwayu'we abo angwana binu kiyi'ga kwa makowe goti. Kwenda kwa kwilaya paminyo ga bandu bai lili, ila kwa ugolou wa mwoyo kamunnyogopa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Kila samupanga, mupange kwa myoyo yinu yoti kati muntumikia Bwana, kwenda munduli. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Muku'mbu'ki panga mwapokya upo ya ulisi bu'ka kwa Bwana. Kilisitu nga Bwana wa kweli ywamuntumikia. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' abawali, kila ywapanga ulau aalu'a pwatilwa kwa kitumbu sa ulau wake.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Na mwenga mwaangwana, mwapangi aki abanda binu kati mwaipalikwa, kamuku'mbu'kya panga, namwenga mubile na Bwana kunani.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malagyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Katu, kanemukotoke saalya! Muyi'me wiso kwa lyolyoti kwo lu'ba no sukulu. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Kai', mutulu'bi twenga li'nga Nnu'ngu' atuyu'gu'li nniango wa kwiala abali yaibu'kana na iyo ya Kilisitu. Kwa kitumbu sa yo, nambi'yambi' nenga nibile muutabilwe. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Munilu'bi nipate kugalongela ganipalikwa longela, li'nga niwese kwiumukwa kweli yi' kwa kila mundu.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Mube na ikima palu' pamupanga makowe pamope na bandu bangali kumwu'bi'lya Yesu. Mutumi wiso wakati winu. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Mayi'gi'yo ginu gabe manogau na go utya masu'ba goti li'nga mutange kunnyangwa wiso kila mundu.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salamu ya kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tikiko, nnongo witu ywapendilwe na ntumisi nnyangu' ywau'bi'li'ka mu Kilisitu Bwana, aalu'a kummakia makowe gangu' goti. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Nintuma kwinu li'nga mupate tanga mu'lu' mwatuyendelya na kunnyi'ya mwoyo. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Nintuma ywembe na Onesimo, nnongo witu ywapendilwe na ywau'bi'li'ka, abo, baalu'a kummakia abali ya makowe goti gagapangika pano, kai' aywo mundu wa kasinu.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Alisitako, ntabilwe nnyangu', endakunsalimia na Maluko mwibaniwe Balanaba, nembe endakunsalimia. Mupokile malagyo gagabu'kana no isa kwa Maluko, mana aikite kasinu mumpoki wiso. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Nembe Yoshua ywakemelwa Yusto endakunsalimia. Mu Ayahudi babapoki imani, aba kisabe bai ngabapanga kasi pamope na nenga kwa kitumbu sa ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'. Kwangu' nenga, abo bapangite ayangatiyi aku'lu'. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafila, ntumisi ywi'ngi' ywa Yesu Kilisitu, kai' mundu ywa kasinu, endakunsalimia. Ywembe akasana kunnu'bya mwenga kila palu'ba li'nga muyi'me kwo kangamala, mukomale kiloo, no yi'ma wiso kwa makowe goti gapala Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Nikong'ondelya panga, endakasana panga kasi kwa kitumbu sinu na kwa bandu ba ilambo ya Laodikia na Hierapoli. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luka, yu'lu' nng'anga witu ywatumpendile, na Dema, bendakunsalimia.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Salamu yitu kwa alongo ba Laodikia. Mwasalimie dada Nimfa pamope na kipi'nga sa aumini babakwembana kasake. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Balua yi'no mana muyomwi kwisoma, mupange kila ndi'la li'nga ikasomelwe kukanisa lya Walaodikia, na yi'lu' yaniandike kwa Laodikia, isomelwe na mwenga. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Ummakiye Arkipo panga, “Wilinguli wiso kasi yi'lu' yaupeyilwe na Bwana li'nga wiyomoli.” <verse eid="COL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Nenga na Pauli niandika salamu yi'no kwa luboko lwangu' namwene. Muku'mbu'ki panga nibile muutabilwe. Ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' ibe pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>